    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Superb two bedroom mid terrace home with a stylish interior ideally located in a much sought after estate.\r\n\r\nThis amazing home features a front driveway and mature trees leading to an attractive partial red brick facade. The entrance hall has a tiled floor and opens to a light filled kitchen on the right hand side. The L shaped kitchen boasts a tiled floor, splashback tiling and plenty of counter & cupboard space. The spacious open plan living room & dining area enjoys solid wooden floors, a gas fireplace, ornate coving, spotlights and understairs storage. Floor to ceiling glass doors open to a sunny patio & garden which is the perfect place to relax & entertain and also provides room to extend the home. Upstairs consists of two double bedrooms and the family bathroom. Both bedrooms have carpet flooring while the bedroom to the front of the home also has ample fitted wardrobes. The generous sized bathroom features a tiled floor, partially tiled walls, an electric shower and a Velux window. The hotpress and attic are accessed via the landing.\r\n\r\nRothe Abbey is a mature development with manicured communal gardens ideally located just off the South Circular Road. There a host of amenities on your doorstep on South Circular Road, Kilmainham & Rialto including cafes, bars, restaurants and bars. A pedestrian walkway from Rothe Abbey provides a shortcut to the Red Line LUAS stop at Suir Road making access the city centre easily accessible. The Memorial Gardens, IMMA, Phoenix Park & Grand Canal provide excellent outdoor leisure facilities. The new children's hospital at St. James's is a five minute walk away."
      },
      {
